{
  "message": "Your new devlog reports two friends reaching the flag, adding useful playtest feedback but no checkable build. The goal remains at risk because neither the landscape image nor the linked video shows your game. Use the last sprint to publish that small level with launch instructions, a finish and restart, rather than adding content. We’ll meet at the final review; I look forward to your playable link and notes from someone opening it independently ;)",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Publish the reported first level with a playable jump, a finish, restart and clear launch instructions.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask someone outside the team to open the public link without coaching. Record whether they can finish and restart, and what causes the repeated second-pit falls.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

